{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33598","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 七 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平生南北逐蓬飘，待得名成鬓已雕。\n寒浦一从抛钓艇，旧林无处认风飙。\n程途虽喜关河尽，时节犹惊骨肉遥。\n愁策羸蹄更归去，乱山流水满翻潮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33598.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33598","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}